+# Activities
+
+Activities are the events shown in the account timeline. They include card
+changes and comments across the boards you have access to. Deprecated
+`card_collection_changed` events are omitted, while `card_title_changed` events
+are included.
+
+## `GET /:account_slug/activities`
+
+Returns a paginated list of activities, newest first.
+
+__Query Parameters:__
+
+| Parameter | Description |
+|-----------|-------------|
+| `creator_ids[]` | Filter by the ID(s) of the user who performed the activity |
+| `board_ids[]` | Filter by board ID(s) |
+
+__Response:__
+
+```json
+[
+  {
+    "id": "03f5vaeq985jlvwv3arl4srq2",
+    "action": "card_assigned",
+    "created_at": "2025-12-05T19:38:48.540Z",
+    "description": "David assigned JZ to \"First!\"",
+    "particulars": {
+      "assignee_ids": ["03f5v9zjw7pz8717a4no1h8a7"]
+    },
+    "url": "http://app.fizzy.localhost:3006/897362094/cards/4",
+    "eventable_type": "Card",
+    "eventable": {
+      "id": "03f5vaeq985jlvwv3arl4srq2",
+      "number": 4,
+      "title": "First!",
+      "status": "published"
+    },
+    "board": {
+      "id": "03f5v9zkft4hj9qq0lsn9ohcm",
+      "name": "Fizzy",
+      "all_access": true
+    },
+    "creator": {
+      "id": "03f5v9zjw7pz8717a4no1h8a7",
+      "name": "David Heinemeier Hansson"
+    }
+  }
+]
+```
+
+The `particulars` object contains event-specific details:
+
+| Event | Particulars |
+|-------|-------------|
+| Assignment changes | `assignee_ids` |
+| Board changes | `old_board`, `new_board` |
+| Title changes | `old_title`, `new_title` |
+| Triage events | `column` |
+
+Other events return an empty `particulars` object. Missing board, title, or
+column values are returned as empty strings.
+
+The `eventable`, `board`, and `creator` objects use the same representations as
+the cards, comments, boards, and users endpoints.
+
+For card events, `url` opens the card. For comment events, it opens the card
+where the comment was posted and jumps to the comment.
